  "body": "While implementing the special cases defined at https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#the-event-handler-processing-algorithm in Servo, we did some investigations. [This test](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=3794) shows interesting results across browsers:\n- Firefox: true, false, true (ie. supports mouseover special case)\n- Safari/Blink: false, false, true (ie. supports no special cases)\n\nI don't have access to IE/Edge to see their results. If nobody implements the special behaviour for onbeforeunload, we should remove it from the spec.\n",
